{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24895","headline":"句 · 牛僧孺","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"但愁封寄去，魔物或惊禅。\n惟羡东都白居士，年年香积问禅师。\n不是道公狂不得，恨公逢我不教狂。\n地瘦草丛短，求人气色沮。\n凭酒意乃伸。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"牛僧孺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24895.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24895","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}